{"title":"My short interview with Julia Willemyns","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/968937296/0/marginalrevolution~My-short-interview-with-Julia-Willemyns.html","date":1789065816000,"content":"<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://britishprogress.substack.com/p/tyler-cowen-on-podcasts-purchases?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2586633&amp;post_id=206222032&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3vt1nk&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">the link</a>, here is the end bit:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p><strong>Who is the most important thinker of our time?</strong></p>\r\n<p>It’s not about individual thinkers any more. It’s about the internet as this vast organ of knowledge that you can play like a musical instrument, and combining the internet with AI. You can figure out things to an unprecedented degree, and it’s great in a way how much we’ve removed that process from any individual thinker.</p>\r\n<p><strong>What’s your favourite podcast?</strong></p>\r\n<p>My own! It would be weird if it wasn’t, right?</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Fun throughout, from the Centre for British Progress.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/09/my-short-interview-with-julia-willemyns.html\">My short interview with Julia Willemyns</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/968937296/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/968937296/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/968937296/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" 